        "Skrop oliwą (15 ml), posyp bazylią (1 g) i solą.",
      ],
      "suggested_seasonings": ["świeża bazylia", "oregano"],
    },
    "en_GB": {
      "name": "Caprese sandwiches",
      "description":
          "An Italian classic in a sandwich — tomato, mozzarella and basil.",
      "instructions": [
        "Slice the bread (120 g), mozzarella (125 g) and tomatoes (200 g).",
        "Arrange alternating slices of cheese and tomato on the bread.",
        "Drizzle with olive oil (15 ml) and sprinkle with basil (1 g) and salt.",
      ],
      "suggested_seasonings": ["fresh basil", "oregano"],
    },
    "de": {
      "name": "Caprese-Sandwiches",
      "description":
          "Ein italienischer Klassiker in einem Sandwich - Tomate, Mozzarella und Basilikum.",
      "instructions": [
