        "Cook the lentils (150 g) in salted water for about 10-12 minutes, then drain and cool.",
        "Chop the tomatoes (200 g) and crumble the feta.",
        "Mix all the ingredients and drizzle with olive oil (15 ml).",
        "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      ],
      "suggested_seasonings": ["cumin", "fresh mint"],
